{{wikipedia}}
==English==

===Noun===
{{en-noun|head=[[pituitary]] [[gland]]}}

# {{context|anatomy|lang=en}} An [[endocrine gland]], about the size of a pea, that sits in a small, bony cavity at the base of the brain whose secretions control the other endocrine glands and influence growth, metabolism, and maturation.

